WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Kitten, if you have free time, just go and leave. Don't hold Kang Jian.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,000
He has been dragged down by you for long enough without you.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,360
Our family can live better

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:09,410
Everyone has his own ambitions. Let's go. Captain Han, we will go with you.

5
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,890
There is a student whose family is used to this place.

6
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:12,810
Won't go

7
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:14,890
Professor Wang, where are you going?

8
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:17,330
Can you bring it with you?

9
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,290
They used to be a research institute

10
00:00:18,290 --> 00:00:19,730
Canteen staff can cook

11
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:23,700
Can I take it with me on the trip?

12
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,100
Just twenty-one gathered together

13
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,600
Have you thought about it?

14
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,180
Not someone we can move base to

15
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,500
I want to take you outside

16
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,530
I don’t know what Professor Wang’s vision is.

17
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:34,890
He never misses his choice

18
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,420
you will see soon

19
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,860
How many pairs are there for this choice?

20
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,170
Are others here to show off and deceive?

21
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:44,170
How could he be treated so well? Have you figured out who he is?

22
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:47,130
Be careful that he will sell you out as soon as you leave the base. Why should you say that?
